#: ../../part1-foundations/index.md:12 bdc8d32f3be548df971aa253a7402a18
msgid "Part I — Foundations"
msgstr "第一部分 —— 基础"

#: ../../part1-foundations/index.md:22 137bc087da394d7c80b6e8a923298a74
msgid "Why"
msgstr "为什么"

#: ../../part1-foundations/index.md:24 ddd38902fbbb4e6f89df1f1e58d0ca90
msgid ""
"Software teams accumulate fragmented knowledge — code, tickets, chats, "
"design docs, runbooks — faster than humans can curate it. Traditional "
"documentation cannot keep up. Part I establishes *what a software knowledge "
"base is*, *why AI changes the economics of building one*, and *what prior IR"
" / RAG / documentation research we will be standing on* throughout the rest "
"of the book."
msgstr ""
"软件团队积累的碎片化知识 —— 代码、工单、聊天、设计文档、runbook —— "
"堆积的速度远远快过人工能整理的速度。传统意义上的“写文档”根本跟不上。第一部分要把三件事讲清楚：*什么是软件知识库*、*为什么 AI "
"改变了构建知识库的经济账*，以及 *本书后文要站在哪些 IR / RAG / 文档研究的肩膀上*。"

#: ../../part1-foundations/index.md:31 7cd4482ef2b74b9f8995124db334a85f
msgid "What"
msgstr "是什么"

#: ../../part1-foundations/index.md:33 0a4f582007384cf4b83eee08f85fba09
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A working definition of \"software knowledge base\", a primer on the "
"relevant information-retrieval and retrieval-augmented-generation building "
"blocks, and the Diátaxis {cite}`procida_diataxis` doc-type model we will "
"reuse when classifying prose content."
msgstr ""
"一份可用的“软件知识库”定义、一份关于信息检索（IR）与检索增强生成（RAG）基础组件的入门介绍，以及本书在分类文本内容时会反复使用的 Diátaxis"
" {cite}`procida_diataxis` 文档类型模型。"

#: ../../part1-foundations/index.md:38 ae0150e8ec6a4019bb04a649668eba47
msgid "How"
msgstr "怎么做"

#: ../../part1-foundations/index.md:40 ea3f6df807344befaef6918a9815799c
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A short methodological overview of the book: three anchor sources (the "
"prose-layer reference implementation, the code-layer reference "
"implementation, and the author's methodology blog post "
"{cite}`fanyamin2026deepwiki`), the theory→practice ratio, and how each Part "
"applies the same Why → What → How → Example → Conclusion → Reference arc."
msgstr ""
"本书方法论的一个速写：三条锚定来源（文本层参考实现、代码层参考实现、作者那篇方法论博客 "
"{cite}`fanyamin2026deepwiki`），理论与实践的配比，以及每一部分如何套用同一条 “Why → What → How → "
"Example → Conclusion → Reference” 的骨架。"

#: ../../part1-foundations/index.md:47 385bf88df3e24f74a266ccabd68b186a
msgid "Example"
msgstr "示例"

#: ../../part1-foundations/index.md:49 8826f47f4f624083b9aa2a5710687fca
msgid ""
"A one-page walkthrough illustrating what \"ask the KB\" feels like once the "
"full stack is in place, deferring implementation details to later Parts."
msgstr "用一页纸演示一下：当整套技术栈都就位时，“向知识库提问”大致是什么体感 —— 具体实现细节留给后面的章节展开。"

#: ../../part1-foundations/index.md:52 3fce421364dc430baaa582dafcd83a20
msgid "Conclusion"
msgstr "小结"

#: ../../part1-foundations/index.md:54 9ed7a0b4a4e1468fba477434a90d7086
msgid ""
"Part I gives the vocabulary and the reading order. It does not build "
"anything yet — that starts in Part II."
msgstr "第一部分给出术语表和阅读顺序，这里还没开始“造东西” —— 动手造是从第二部分开始的。"

